Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一条真实的自主实验室产线。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.52,EN,,0,0,0,,This is a real autonomous laboratory production line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,十台移液工站沿两侧一字排开，中间留出三点二米的通道。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:10.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Ten liquid-handling stations line both sides, with a 3.2-metre aisle down the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:15.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,这条通道的宽度，来自两台移动机器人双向交会所需的距离。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:15.81,EN,,0,0,0,,That width comes from what two mobile robots need to pass each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,从物料进厂到成品出库，整条线只有一个控制输入。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.82,EN,,0,0,0,,From incoming material to finished goods, the whole line runs on a single input.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,它不是动画，是一个可以用参数重算的数字样机。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:24.84,EN,,0,0,0,,This is not an animation. It is a digital mock-up you can recompute from parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:28.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,从上方看，布局的逻辑很直接。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:28.27,EN,,0,0,0,,From above, the logic of the layout is straightforward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:32.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,左侧五台，右侧五台，交错镜像。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:32.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Five on the left, five on the right, mirrored and staggered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一台都是独立的自动化单元，故障可以单点隔离，不会拖垮全线。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Each is an independent cell, so a fault can be isolated instead of taking down the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:43.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,物料从东端进来，成品从东端出去，人和车在空间上彻底分开。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:43.07,EN,,0,0,0,,Material enters at the east end and leaves there too, keeping people and vehicles apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,两台车共用一套路线，一台送料，一台回收，车速一点二米每秒。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Two vehicles share one route, one feeding and one collecting, at 1.2 metres per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,打开一台工位。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:51.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Open one station.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,七轴协作臂的正前方，有三个位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:54.57,EN,,0,0,0,,Directly in front of the seven-axis arm are three positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,左边是毛坯垛，中间是工作位，右边是成品垛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:58.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Raw trays on the left, the work position in the middle, finished trays on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.34,0:01:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,机械臂夹的不是板，是托盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.34,0:01:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,The arm does not grip the plate. It grips a tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:07.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,一百五十毫米宽的标准托盘，侧壁五毫米，那正好是夹爪唯一能咬住的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:07.08,EN,,0,0,0,,A standard 150-millimetre tray, with a five-millimetre wall that is the only thing a gripper can hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个循环六秒。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:09.04,EN,,0,0,0,,One cycle takes six seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,先把成品从工作位取走，送进成品垛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:12.12,EN,,0,0,0,,First it takes the finished tray out of the work position and stacks it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:15.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,再回到毛坯垛，取下一盘，放进工作位。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:15.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Then it returns to the raw stack, picks the next tray and loads the work position.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:19.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,先取后放，这是单臂单工位唯一讲得通的顺序。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:19.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Unload before you load. With one arm and one fixture, that is the only order that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:22.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,整段动作由十四个关键帧定义。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:22.67,EN,,0,0,0,,The whole motion is defined by fourteen keyframes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:26.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,帧间最大位移六十四毫米，没有一帧是手拉的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:26.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Peak travel between frames is 64 millimetres. Not a single frame is hand-animated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:29.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,工位上方是一条龙门天轨。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:29.05,EN,,0,0,0,,Above the stations runs a gantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:36.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,它从移动机器人的料架上取托盘，升到二点六米，横移到工位顶部的投料口，再放下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:36.14,EN,,0,0,0,,It lifts a tray off the mobile robot, rises to 2.6 metres, crosses to the hatch on top of the station and lowers it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,横梁为什么会压得这么低。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Why is the crossbeam set so low.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.98,0:01:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为顶上两条风管的底面在二点八一，横梁只能走在它下面。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.98,0:01:42.33,EN,,0,0,0,,Because the ducts overhead bottom out at 2.81 metres, the beam has nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是几何约束，不是审美选择。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:45.80,EN,,0,0,0,,That is a geometric constraint, not an aesthetic choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:50.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,天轨、工位臂、复合机器人的动作窗口，是互相锁死的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:50.81,EN,,0,0,0,,The motion envelopes of gantry, station arm and mobile manipulator are interlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:53.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,车和工位之间，还有一层接驳。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:53.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Between the vehicle and the station sits one more layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,复合机器人停在工位前，从伸出的接料台上取走成品托盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:58.71,EN,,0,0,0,,The mobile manipulator parks in front, takes a finished tray from the transfer shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:02.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,转身，放到自己的台面上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:02.03,EN,,0,0,0,,Turns and sets it on its own deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,它不负责搬运，只负责把东西从柜子里接出来，剩下的一段路由移动机器人完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:08.68,EN,,0,0,0,,It does not haul cargo. It hands off from the cabinet, and the base vehicle carries the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:15.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,天轨下探的时候，工位臂会自动让位，实测最小间隙零点八二米。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:15.42,EN,,0,0,0,,When the gantry descends, the station arm yields. Measured minimum clearance: 0.82 metres.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,臂还停在窗口区域时，滑窗禁止关闭。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:19.82,EN,,0,0,0,,While the arm is still in the window zone, the sash is locked open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.82,0:02:26.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,天轨作业时，窗口强制关合，这一条防的不是机器人，是人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.82,0:02:26.07,EN,,0,0,0,,While the gantry works overhead, the sash is forced shut. That rule is not for the robot, it is for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:30.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,外围是安全围栏、入口光幕，和四路吸顶监控。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:30.47,EN,,0,0,0,,Around it: perimeter fencing, an entry light curtain and four ceiling cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,光幕只装在人员入口，不装在车道上，否则每过一台车就会停机。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:35.82,EN,,0,0,0,,The curtain guards the personnel door, not the vehicle lane, where every pass would trip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,线体东端是两个料区。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:38.18,EN,,0,0,0,,At the east end of the line sit two material zones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,蓝色是毛坯，绿色是成品。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:40.65,EN,,0,0,0,,Blue for raw, green for finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:47.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,托盘本体色、前脸标签条、是否封膜，三层信息同时成立。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:47.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Tray colour, face label and whether the plate is sealed: three layers of the same signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:50.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,站在任何一个距离，至少有一种能读出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:50.17,EN,,0,0,0,,At any distance, at least one of them still reads.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,点开任意一台工站，右侧会展开这一台的物料清单。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:54.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Click any station and its bill of materials opens on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,滑块往下拉，整台设备逐层散开。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.69,EN,,0,0,0,,Drag the slider and the enclosure comes apart layer by layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:03:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,切到剖面，钣金变成半透明，内部结构一目了然。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:03:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Switch to section and the sheet metal turns translucent, exposing what is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有视角、所有读数，都挂在同一条时间轴上。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:06.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Every view and every readout hangs off the same timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:11.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,时间轴可以拖动，拖到哪一秒，画面就停在哪一秒。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:11.09,EN,,0,0,0,,Drag the timeline and the picture stops on exactly that second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,五个机位，三档剖切，都是真按钮，不是示意图。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Five camera presets and three cut modes. Real controls, not illustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,屏幕上每一个数字都是算出来的，不是写死的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:19.25,EN,,0,0,0,,Every number on screen is computed, not typed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:25.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,台面横梁跨中挠度零点五四毫米，一阶固有频率十六点八赫兹。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:25.05,EN,,0,0,0,,Mid-span deflection of the deck beam is 0.54 millimetres, first natural frequency 16.8 hertz.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:29.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个值低于精密台面二十五赫兹的门槛，所以标了警示色。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:29.15,EN,,0,0,0,,That sits below the 25-hertz floor for a precision deck, so it is flagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:32.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,真正的改法是缩跨距，不是加厚型材。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:32.77,EN,,0,0,0,,The fix is a shorter span, not a thicker profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:39.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,基座螺栓拉力零点七九千牛，对十五点三千牛的预紧，只占百分之五。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:39.49,EN,,0,0,0,,Base bolt load is 0.79 kilonewtons against 15.3 of preload, only five percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:44.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,整机抗倾覆系数十二点五，安全余量在刚度上，不在强度上。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:44.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Tipping resistance is 12.5. The margin lives in stiffness, not in strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:48.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,改一个参数，模型和读数一起重算，不需要重新做一遍。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:48.65,EN,,0,0,0,,Change one parameter and model and readouts recompute together, with no rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:53.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一个可以被拆开、被复算、被质疑的模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:53.14,EN,,0,0,0,,This is a model you can take apart, recompute and argue with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,它也不完美。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.22,EN,,0,0,0,,It is not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:58.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,频率不够，臂展偏紧，我都标在了面板上。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:58.51,EN,,0,0,0,,The frequency is low and the reach is tight, and both are flagged on the panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:01.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,完整工程档案在右边，可以逐条对着看。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:01.90,EN,,0,0,0,,The full engineering dossier is on the right, item by item.
